WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.953
Install the Scry native capture skill with npx skills add,

2
00:00:05.003 --> 00:00:09.121
then ask your assistant to set up Scry capture.

3
00:00:09.171 --> 00:00:14.351
It adds the launch hook, screen registry and capture scripts.

4
00:00:14.401 --> 00:00:20.567
With a simulator or emulator available, it runs the capture and a dry run.

5
00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:25.114
Otherwise it hands you the commands to run on a Mac.

6
00:00:25.164 --> 00:00:28.272
It never uploads without your go.

